==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Anti-Red units like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]], or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] should be more than enough for this stage. You can use Courier, Crazed Whale cat, and Can Can Cat as attackers and simply protect them with meatshields or use Roe Cat to weaken the units and tank them until your attackers finish the enemies off.

